        {
          "ref": "TMM/Part2/1/trade-mark-regulations-1995",
          "quote": "Regulation 21.3 Filing of documents - common requirements Regulation 21.4 Consequences for documents not meeting filing requirements Regulation 21.5 Filing of documents - date of receipt to be marked"
        }
      ],
      "authority": "manual"
    },
    {
      "text": "Regulation 4.4 sets out how an application must specify the goods and/or services for the purposes of paragraph 27(3)(b) of the Act.",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "ref": "TMR1995/r4.4",
          "quote": "(1) For the purposes of paragraph 27(3)(b) of the Act, the following subregulations set out the manner of specifying, in an application for the registration of a trade mark, the goods and/or services in respect of which registration is sought."
        }
      ],
      "authority": "legislation"
    },
    {
      "text": "For classification associated with the specification, the Manual also identifies regulation 3.1 and Schedule 1.",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "ref": "TMM/Part14/x-relevant-legislation10#1",
          "quote": "Reg 3.1 Classification of goods and services"
        },
        {
          "ref": "TMM/Part14/x-relevant-legislation10#1",
          "quote": "Schedule 1 Classification of goods and services"
        }
      ],
      "authority": "manual"
    },
    {
      "text": "For priority claims, the Manual identifies regulation 4.5 (period for claiming priority) and regulation 4.6 (how to claim priority).",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "ref": "TMM/Part2/1/trade-mark-regulations-1995",
          "quote": "Regulation 4.5 Period for claiming priority of an application Regulation 4.6 How to claim priority"
        }
      ],
      "authority": "manual"
    },
    {
      "text": "For declarations, the Manual identifies regulation 21.6 (declarations) and regulation 21.7 (additional material).",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "ref": "TMM/Part2/1/trade-mark-regulations-1995",
          "quote": "Regulation 21.6 Declarations Regulation 21.7 Declarations - additional material"
        }
      ],
      "authority": "manual"
    },
    {
      "text": "For notices of non-payment of a fee, the Manual identifies regulation 21.23.",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "ref": "TMM/Part2/1/trade-mark-regulations-1995",
          "quote": "Regulation 21.23 Notice of non-payment of fee"
        }
      ],
      "authority": "manual"
    },
    {
      "text": "For a TM Headstart request, the Manual identifies regulation 3A.3 as covering filing requirements.",
      "quotes": [
        {
          "ref": "TMM/Part2/3/2/3/2/1",
          "quote": "The requirements for filing a TM Headstart request are covered in reg 3A.3"
        }
      ],
      "authority": "manual"
    },
    {
      "text": "These are provision references supported by the supplied passages, not an exhaustive account of applicable requirements; apart from regulation 4.4, the text of the identified Regulations is not supplied.",
